units real
atom_style full
boundary p p p

pair_style lj/class2/coul/long 9.0 9.0
pair_modify mix sixthpower
bond_style class2
angle_style class2
dihedral_style class2
improper_style none
kspace_style pppm 1.0e-4
special_bonds lj/coul 0.0 0.0 1.0 angle no dihedral no

read_data minimized.data

pair_coeff 1 1 0.10 3.50
pair_coeff 2 2 0.08 3.10
pair_coeff 3 3 0.05 2.40
pair_coeff 4 4 0.06 4.10
bond_coeff 1 1.49 235.0 -33.0 7.5
angle_coeff 1 111.5 31.0 -3.4 1.0
angle_coeff 1 bb 5.2 1.49 1.49
angle_coeff 1 ba 1.8 1.5 1.49 1.49
dihedral_coeff 1 0.95 0.0 0.55 180.0 0.35 0.0
dihedral_coeff 1 mbt 0.15 -0.09 0.05 1.49
dihedral_coeff 1 ebt 0.13 -0.06 0.03 0.11 -0.04 0.02 1.49 1.49
dihedral_coeff 1 at 0.05 -0.03 0.02 0.04 -0.02 0.01 111.5 111.5
dihedral_coeff 1 aat 0.24 111.5 111.5
dihedral_coeff 1 bb13 0.17 1.49 1.49

velocity all create 300.0 20260407 dist gaussian mom yes rot yes
reset_timestep 0
timestep 1.0
fix 1 all npt temp 300.0 300.0 100 iso 246.7308167 246.7308167 5000
thermo 100
thermo_style custom step temp pe ke etotal press vol density
thermo_modify flush yes
run 100000
write_data final.data
